# ========================================================
# PORTFOLIO CONTACT FORM CONFIGURATION (.env)
# ========================================================
# Where you want to receive portfolio messages:
CONTACT_EMAIL_TO=your-email@example.com

# ========================================================
# OPTION 1: Web3Forms REST API (FASTEST & EASIEST - 100% FREE)
# ========================================================
# 1. Visit: https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your email, copy the Access Key you receive, and paste below:
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# ========================================================
# OPTION 2: Resend REST API (MODERN DEVELOPER STANDARD)
# ========================================================
# 1. Visit: https://resend.com (Free 3,000 emails/month)
# 2. Generate an API key and paste below:
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here
# CONTACT_EMAIL_FROM="Portfolio Contact" <onboarding@resend.dev>

# ========================================================
# OPTION 3: Traditional SMTP (Gmail, AWS SES, Outlook, etc.)
# ========================================================
# For Gmail App Password:
#   1. Enable 2-Step Verification in Google Account
#   2. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#   3. Create an App Password for "Mail" and paste below:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-gmail-address@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
# CONTACT_EMAIL_FROM="Portfolio Contact" <your-gmail-address@gmail.com>
